      "statement": "The runtime chooses fixture-only catalog and providers when neither Pipeboard nor direct tools are configured; it combines fixture and direct reads when only direct adapters are configured, and with a Pipeboard token it refreshes a Pipeboard catalog and returns composite reads plus a separate Pipeboard write provider.",
